      "short": "above setpoint",
      "ok": "at setpoint"
    }
  },
  "plant": "Dry coolers reject the liquid loop's heat (and the trim chillers' condenser heat). The CDU holds TCS supply; the free-cooling margin P4 = (TCS supply − CDU approach) − (ambient + dry-cooler approach).",
